<div id="panel-dialog-overview">
    <h1>Panel Dialog Component</h1>
    
    <p>
        Panel dialogs are modal and require a close button. They fill the entire y-axis of the screen and a portion of the x-axis.
    </p>
    <p>
        The dialog must remain in a
        <span class="highlight">
            hidden
        </span>
         state for all users and devices until opened.
    </p>
</div>
